  "release_changes": "## 🚀 Features\n\n- feat(auth): enable ChatGPT plan reviews through public Responses (#1622)\n- feat(acp): support ACP service for OpenCodeReview (#1218)\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: follow up ChatGPT auth recovery and provider credentials (#1622) (#1718)\n- fix(scan): record rendered prompt overflow as a failed review (#1652)\n- fix(agent): make deleted files readable through file_read_diff (#1698)\n- fix(agent): list deleted files under their own path in the change list (#1680)\n- fix(opencode): preserve OCR output on Windows (#1606)\n\n## 📖 Documentation\n\n- docs(delegate): prevent pager hangs; ci: upgrade Go and x/net (#1062)\n\n## Other Changes\n\n- ci(release): publish to npm via trusted publishing (#1732)\n- test(allowlist): catch an extension disappearing from the allowlist (#1626)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/compare/v1.12.13...v1.13.0",
